#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:31
msgid ""
"Extended info with SKU, unit price, full tax breakdown, customer address, and cashier details."
msgstr ""
"Udvidede oplysninger med SKU, enhedspris, fuldt skatteoverblik, kundeadresse og kassedetaljer."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:44
msgid ""
"Items listed without prices. Includes gift message from customer note and return reference."
msgstr ""
"Varer uden priser. Inkluderer gavebesked fra kundens note og returreferencenummer."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:57
msgid ""
"Full-page A4/Letter invoice with bill-to/ship-to addresses, an itemised products table, and an optional \"How to pay\" panel (bank transfer + QR-encoded order-pay URL) shown when the order still needs payment."
msgstr ""
"Faktura i fuld sideformat A4/Letter med fakturerings- og leveringsadresser, en vareopdelt produkttabel og et valgfrit panel \"Sådan betaler du\" (bankoverførsel + QR-kodet order-pay-URL), som vises, når ordren stadig mangler betaling."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:68
msgid "Minimal / Modern"
msgstr "Minimal / Moderne"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:70
msgid ""
"Compact receipt with a centered store header, bold double-border order band and dense item rows. Same essentials as Standard, less vertical space."
msgstr ""
"Kompakt kvittering med centreret butiksheader, markant ordrebånd med dobbelt kant og tætte varelinjer. Samme nødvendigheder som Standard, mindre lodret plads."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:81
msgid "Narrow Receipt"
msgstr "Smal kvittering"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:83
msgid ""
"Compact monospace receipt sized for narrow paper or HTML-capable thermal printers. Prints cleanly in black and white."
msgstr ""
"Kompakt kvittering i monospace til smalt papir eller termoprintere med HTML-understøttelse. Udskrives rent i sort-hvid."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:95
msgid ""
"Fulfillment companion with items and quantities only. No pricing. Shipping address prominent."
msgstr ""
"Fuldførelsesbilag med kun varer og antal. Ingen priser. Forsendelsesadressen er fremhævet."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:106
msgid "Quote / Estimate"
msgstr "Tilbud / Overslag"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:108
msgid ""
"Pre-sale document with items and pricing. No payment section. Includes validity notice and terms."
msgstr ""
"Forhåndssalgsdokument med varer og priser. Ingen betalingssektion. Inkluderer gyldighedsmeddelelse og vilkår."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:119
msgid "Standard Receipt"
msgstr "Standardkvittering"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:121
msgid ""
"Streamlined receipt with logo, store info, itemized lines, totals and payment — covers what most stores need without the kitchen sink."
msgstr ""
"Strømlinet kvittering med logo, butiksoplysninger, varelinjer, totaler og betaling - dækker det, de fleste butikker har brug for, uden alt det ekstra."

